# KITWE_PRODUCTS_SET_DISPLAY_LOCKED

**AI agents:** Do not edit Kitwe set display / component hiding / inlay UI unless the user **explicitly** asks to change `/kitwe-products` set behaviour in the current message.

Read **`docs/kitwe-products-set-display.md`** before any authorized change.

## Rules

- Sets on `/kitwe-products` must use **`isKitweCatalogSetAssembly`** (portal flag and/or Kitwe `warehouse_set_items` recipe).
- Set recipe components stay **hidden** from the product table unless `kitwe_catalog_loose`.
- Set rows must keep **expand/inlay** for components (`kitwe-expand-btn`, `kitwe-set-panel`).
- Keep lock markers (`KITWE_PRODUCTS_SET_DISPLAY_LOCKED`) in touched files; run verify scripts from the doc.